# I. Corporate profile

# Main battalion business

The multiplicity of public utility companies, which are important players in China and in the global electricity sector, operates through two main platforms:
- **Major Station**: China ' s social power provider platform, starting in the "low price plus puzzle" mode, covering the full range of items such as 100 days, fresh, clothing, home appliances, etc.
- **Temu**: Cross-border power provider platform, which was launched in September 2022, currently covers 80+ countries and areas worldwide

The company was listed in NASDAQ in 2018 and has headquarters in Shanghai and Dublin.

